          "lineage": "verbatim",
          "injection_risk": "untrusted_content",
          "body": "Invoices are emailed to the billing contact on every charge and are listed under Billing, then Invoices, as PDF downloads. To add a VAT or tax ID, edit Billing details; it appears on every invoice issued after the change."
        },
